en gare.<br><br>Pour plus d&#8217;informations rendez vous sur le <a href=\"https:\/\/malignej.transilien.com\/\">Blog Ligne J<\/a><\/p>","shortMessage":"Trafic perturbé","disruption_id":"b35f2c67-78c0-4b1f-876c-c0b487e285e7"},{"id":"65027cdb-472f-425f-804e-342868239cd7","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20260908T080843","end":"20260908T093000"}],"lastUpdate":"20260908T081142","cause":"PERTURBATION","severity":"PERTURBEE","title":"Ligne H : ralentissements","message":"<p>Le trafic est ralenti entre Paris Gare du Nord et Persan - Beaumont via Montsoult - Maffliers et entre Paris Gare du Nord et Luzarches dans les 2 sens.<br><br>Pour plus d'informations sur cette perturbation, consultez le <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/LigneH_SNCF\">fil X de la ligne H<\/a>.<br><br>Motif : panne d'un passage &#224; niveau entre Ecouen et Sarcelles (dysfonctionnement sur les infrastructures du r&#233;seau ferroviaire).<\/p>","shortMessage":"Trafic perturbé","impactedSections":[{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01737","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:67177","name":"Luzarches (Luzarches)"},"to":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:71410","name":"Gare du Nord (Paris)"}},{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01737","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:67292","name":"Persan - Beaumont (Persan)"},"to":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:71410","name":"Gare du Nord (Paris)"}},{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01737","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:71410","name":"Gare du Nord (Paris)"},"to":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:67177","name":"Luzarches (Luzarches)"}},{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01737","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:71410","name":"Gare du Nord (Paris)"},"to":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:67292","name":"Persan - Beaumont (Persan)"}}],"disruption_id":"cd13679d-e7e1-4d6f-af02-02d666472e1a"},{"id":"e46bd76a-f2ce-45a3-9903-d353ef16a839","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20260906T030000","end":"20261001T030000"}],"lastUpdate":"20260907T040341","caus